{"id":"vod_lz_41920","vodId":"41920","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠GT","name_cn":"龙珠GT","date":"1996-01-01","year":"1996","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20221207-1/b3d711c812216e16d60a99cffee9c1e5.jpg"},"summary":"许多年过去，地球在Z战士的保卫下日渐和平与繁荣。某天，皮拉夫大王和他的爪牙历经千辛万苦来到神殿，找到了神仙与比克大魔王分身前制造的黑星龙珠。由于孙悟空的突然出现，皮拉夫慌忙之中许下让孙悟空变成少年模样的愿望。在此之后，黑星龙珠散落到宇宙各个角落，如果在一年之内无法找到七颗黑星龙珠的话，地球将会爆炸毁灭。情况危急，小悟空和孙女小芳开始了一段惊险刺激的宇宙大冒险。超级17号、邪恶龙等强大的对手接连出现，悟空面临更大的挑战……　　本片根据鸟山明人气原著漫画《龙珠》改编，不过剧情并非鸟山明原创，系东映动画公司取得授权后全新创作的动画。鸟山明参与了部分的人设工作。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-12-02 21:17:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":64,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33805_4f5a9f8f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33806_6874fe2f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33808_f7458277/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33807_2d2d55db/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33810_aeeb1993/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33809_d551aa1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33811_bbfa4216/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33812_d87b05c7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33813_ab78795f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33814_9af147cc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33815_5e6f4691/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33816_0c300ed3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33817_83342eb0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn6.com/20221201/33818_bbb59725/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url